  "description": "Demolition of existing pool house and construction of new pool house with covered outside dining",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed pool house would result in the loss of a tree which is the subject of\r\na Tree Preservation Order, reference T20.&amp;nbsp; No details have been provided\r\nregarding its type, health, category or justification for its loss. Therefore,\r\nthe proposal would be contrary to The National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow\r\nCore Strategy (2012), policy DM 1 and DM22 of the Harrow Development Management\r\nPolicies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document:\r\nResidential Design Guide (2010) and GR1 of the Draft Harrow Local Plan.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
